      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesn't feel like a pause though. it feels like the end. i look at my desk and i just see the graveyard of things i'll never be able to do again. it's embarrassing, really. everyone thinks i'm this \"artist\" but i'm just a fraud who ran out of things to say. the world just keeps moving and i'm just... stuck in this emptiness. it's exhausting trying to find a way back to a person who doesn't exist anymore.",
